nce.","abilities":["More likely to be attacked by allied units","Increases Blood Debt when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":9000,"atk":500,"def":900,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"famiglia_caster":{"slug":"famiglia_caster","name":"Famiglia Caster","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Caster.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"For Famiglia-trained Casters, their Originium Arts are the basis of their standing within the famiglia. Though these Casters have fairly mediocre Arts, they at least are effective at inciting hatred.","abilities":["Attacks two targets simultaneously.","Can stop attacking to continually increase Blood Debt"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":4500,"atk":320,"def":250,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"siracusan_civilian":{"slug":"siracusan_civilian","name":"Siracusan Civilian","icon":"/enemies-icons/Siracusan Civilian.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"These Siracusan civilians seem to have strayed into the fighting despite having been evacuated along with the rest of the crowd earlier. For whatever reason, whenever an accident of any sort happens, everyone's wrath falls upon you.","abilities":["Gradually reduces Blood Debt over time while on the battlefield; however, increases Blood Debt by a significant amount upon dying"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":3000,"atk":0,"def":50,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":null}},"famiglia_capo":{"slug":"famiglia_capo","name":"Famiglia Capo","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Capo.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement